---
unit: 8.1.1
title: 'Practical activity: Find a fun plan for Saturday afternoon'
---
{% slideshow %}
{% slide align="center" %}
### Practical activity

### HELP MARCO!

### Find a fun plan for Saturday afternoon
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="How do we play? (Instructions)" align="center" %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
Marco is very bored today.

We are going to help Marco.

First, we choose a fun plan for him.

Next, we order the steps he must follow.

Finally, we choose the right digital tool.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
{% arasaac #34705 alt="Pictogram of a list of instructions" size=300 /%}
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="What plan do we choose today?" align="center" %}
We can choose between three different plans:

PLAN 1: Go to the cinema to watch a movie.

PLAN 2: Go to a music concert.

PLAN 3: Go on a hiking route in nature.
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Plan 1 - Go to the Cinema" align="center" %}
Help Marco order these three actions (1 from 3)

{% orderGame
   items=[{text: "See what movies are playing today"}, {text: "Find out the session times"}, {text: "Call a friend to go with him"}] /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Plan 1 - What tool do we use?" align="center" %}
Match each step with its digital tool:

{% matchingGame
   pairs=[{leftText: "See movies and schedules", rightText: "Cinema app or website."}, {leftText: "Call a friend", rightText: "Mobile phone or WhatsApp."}, {leftText: "Find directions to the cinema", rightText: "Google Maps."}] /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Plan 2 - Go to a Concert" align="center" %}
Help Marco order these three actions (1 from 3)

{% orderGame
   items=[{text: "Search for music bands playing in the city."}, {text: "Find what transport takes him to the concert."}, {text: "Buy the ticket online."}] /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Plan 2 - What tool do we use?" align="center" %}
Match each step with its digital tool:

{% matchingGame
   pairs=[{leftText: "Search for music bands", rightText: "Spotify, YouTube, or ChatGPT."}, {leftText: "Buy the ticket", rightText: "Ticket sales website."}, {leftText: "Find the bus or train", rightText: "Transport app or Google Maps."}] /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Plan 3 - Hiking Route" align="center" %}
Help Marco order these three actions (1 from 3)

{% orderGame
   items=[{text: "Check the weather forecast to know if it will rain."}, {text: "Search for an easy route close to home."}, {text: "Prepare the backpack with water and food."}] /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Plan 3 - What tool do we use?" align="center" %}
Match each step with its digital tool:

{% matchingGame
   pairs=[{leftText: "Search for an easy route", rightText: "Map app or Wikiloc."}, {leftText: "Check the weather in the city", rightText: "Weather or climate app."}, {leftText: "Prepare the backpack", rightText: "Ask a supporter, family member or AI."}] /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Excellent job!" align="center" %}
Thanks to your help, Marco now has his plan.

Today we learned something very important:

- Technology helps us find leisure ideas.
- Planning our activities helps us be more independent.

{% arasaac
   #38564
   alt="Pictogram of a person doing a thumbs up gesture with both hands. Meaning: \"Very good\""
   size=300 /%}
{% /slide %}
{% /slideshow %}
